namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath.h#DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath
    src   "Lays a text's glyphs along a path: a circle, an arc, or another widget's Path. Each glyph goes to the point as far\nalong the path as it was along the line, turned to follow the path (or, with Bend Glyphs, bent along it), lifted off\nthe path by Baseline Offset; Align, Start Offset and Letter Spacing place the run, Flip puts it on the path's other\nside, and Offset Speed scrolls it along -- a marquee.\n\nIt runs after the modifiers that work on characters, so a text animation's moves are kept: a character it lifts is\nlifted off the path, one it turns is turned from the path's direction. On anything but a text, the whole mesh is bent\nalong the path."
    text  "将文本的字形沿路径排列：圆形、圆弧或其他控件的路径。每个字形会移动到路径上的对应点，该点在路径上的距离与其在线性文本中的位置相同，\n并朝向路径方向（启用弯曲字形时则沿路径弯曲），再按基线偏移抬离\n路径；对齐、起始偏移和字距决定这段文本的位置，翻转会将其放到路径的另一\n侧，偏移速度则让它沿路径滚动——形成跑马灯。\n\n它在作用于字符的修改器之后运行，因此文本动画的运动会被保留：被抬起的字符会\n从路径上抬离，被旋转的字符会转向路径方向。对于文本以外的对象，整个网格会沿\n路径弯曲。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath:BaselineOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath.h#DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath:BaselineOffset
    src   "How far off the path the anchor line sits, in local units, outward from the path's left side."
    text  "锚线距路径的距离，单位为局部单位，从路径左侧向外计算。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath:bBendGlyphs {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath.h#DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath:bBendGlyphs
    src   "Bends each glyph along the path, rather than turning it whole to the path's direction at its middle."
    text  "沿路径弯曲每个字形，而不是在字形中点处将其整体转向路径方向。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath:bFlip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath.h#DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath:bFlip
    src   "Runs the text the other way along the path, on its other side."
    text  "让文本沿路径反向排列，并位于路径的另一侧。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath:bHideOutside {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath.h#DreamMeshModifierTextOnPath:bHideOutside
    src   "On an open path, hides the glyphs whose middle is past either end, instead of carrying them on straight."
    text  "在开放路径上，隐藏中点越过任一端的字形，而不是让它们继续沿直线排列。"
    state machine
}

